		(property "Design Notes" "Pi-filter series element (C31 in / L1 / C32+C33+C7 out) feeding +12VF; keeps buck switching noise off the battery harness. Carries the whole board input current, ~2.5 A worst case at 7 V in, so it is sized on Irms not inductance: 5.8 A Irms at 40 C rise and 6.7 A Isat clear both that load and the 5 A F1 fuse rating. Replaced SRN4018-4R7M, whose 1.9 A Irms / 2.0 A Isat sat below the load; the 19.5 mOhm DCR also cuts the series drop to 49 mV from 210 mV."
			(at 179.07 77.47 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
				)
			)
