		)
		(property "Design Notes" "Reverse-polarity P-FET on the fused battery feed. Replaced DMP6110SFDF (110 mOhm / -3.5 A, U-DFN2020-6) because that part was thermally undersized for the ~2.5 A worst-case input at 7 V. DMP6023LFGQ is -60 V / -7.7 A / 25 mOhm @ -10 V (33 mOhm @ -4.5 V) in PowerDI3333-8, AEC-Q101; VDSS still clears the SM8S26A ~42 V clamp. Gate is R41 pulldown plus D1 10 V Vgs clamp (FET max +/-20 V)."
			(at 142.24 80.01 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
					(size 1.27 1.27)
